  "description" : "http://anidb.net/ch155377 [Soara] is a young orphan girl who was raised by knights and trained to fight against marauding monsters. By the time Soara is old enough to join the fray, her blade is no longer needed, as peace has been declared with monsters. Searching for a new calling, Soara stumbles upon http://anidb.net/ch155376 [Kiriku] the dwarf, Architect of the Monster World. Suddenly, instead of fighting monsters, Soara finds herself working alongside Kiriku to build comfortable homes for monsterkind! In the course of her new career, will Soara find a home for herself?\nSource: Seven Seas Entertainment",
